{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "刘海模式会跟随鼠标所在显示器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notch mode follows the cursor's display."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刘海模式固定在所选显示器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notch mode is fixed to the selected display."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刷新": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双向": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可拖拽窗口，可放在任意位置并始终置顶。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Draggable window, can be placed anywhere and floats on top."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启用远程连接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable Remote Connection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "固定在刘海": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pinned to Notch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "固定在屏幕顶部刘海下方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pinned below the MacBook notch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "固定显示器": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fixed Display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在同一 Wi-Fi 下，使用 iPhone、Android 或电视浏览器扫码或打开该 URL。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan the QR code or open the URL on iPhone, Android, or TV using the same Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在外接显示器或 Sidecar iPad 上显示提词器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show teleprompter on external display or Sidecar iPad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在屏幕共享中隐藏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide in screen share"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在录屏和视频会议中隐藏悬浮层。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide the overlay during screen recordings and video calls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在所选显示器上全屏显示提词器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fullscreen teleprompter on the selected display."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在所选显示器上全屏显示提词器。按 Esc 停止。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fullscreen teleprompter on the selected display. Press Esc to stop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "垂直": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vertical"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "基于开源项目深度定制的中文演讲/录制提词器。\\n\\n• 完整汉化界面\\n• 接入本地语音大模型\\n• 优化中文跟读同步稳定性\\n\\n能在您朗读或口播时，确保文案平滑滚动，不“乱跳”，且无需上传任何语音数据至云端。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A deeply customized teleprompter for Chinese speech/recording based on an open source project.\\n\\n• Fully localized interface\\n• Local voice model integration\\n• Optimized Chinese read-along sync stability\\n\\nEnsures smooth scrolling without \"jumping\" exactly as you speak, keeping your data entirely local."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外接屏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "External Display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外观": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appearance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果是 Keynote 或 Google Slides，\\n请先导出为 PPTX。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For Keynote or Google Slides,\\nexport to PPTX first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "字体": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Font"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "字号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Font Size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成！": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "实时跟踪你说出的每个词并高亮显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tracks and highlights each word in real-time as you speak."
